//   - widget/scroll wraps a charm.land/bubbles/v2/viewport and calls these
//     renderers with its own hover/grab colour state (the foundation for ports
//     over static oversized content).
//   - widgets that ALREADY own a viewport (e.g. widget/textarea, whose bubble
//     scrolls internally) paint a bar from their own scroll state via these
//     renderers, avoiding a second viewport (no double-scroll).
//
